WEBVTT

00:05:59.704 --> 00:06:02.996
and they use that intelligence
in different ways.

00:06:03.413 --> 00:06:10.829
So one was Mike, and he was very low
ranking in a in a group of 11 adult males,

00:06:10.996 --> 00:06:12.371
was right down near the bottom.

00:06:12.996 --> 00:06:15.996
But he just had this motivation
to climb the ladder.

00:06:15.996 --> 00:06:21.538
And some some males do and some males
don't. A big difference there anyhow.

00:06:22.246 --> 00:06:24.829
At that time, you know, it
was feeding the bananas.

00:06:24.829 --> 00:06:27.496
It was the very early days,
nineteen sixty four.

00:06:27.996 --> 00:06:32.663
And we lit the camp at night with
a little paraffin lamps,